{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ab9SpHyTVD1793176939.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西寶城分行高級分行經理楊志能表示，分行新近促成一宗西半山寶翠園買賣成交，單位為6座低層C室，實用面積762平方呎，採2房1套間隔，向西南，望內池景，放盤約1個月，現以1,838萬元成交，折合實用呎價24,121元。</p><p><br/>楊志能表示，新買家為回流港人，心儀寶翠園居住環境舒適寧靜，會所配套齊全，遂決定購入自用。據了解，原業主於2001年以468萬元購入單位，持貨25年，是次轉手賬面獲利1,370萬元，單位升值逾2.9倍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:20.126504+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T03:38:07.692485+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:50.321876+00:00","content_hash":"9f6612664e692fe34126ab6d778d7760acde17ed317fee0c77e5a7df27b53017","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:20.126504+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}